OL,3,GNEWSADesign approved for tourism sign
OL,4,Aat M1 junction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe design for a brown sign which would
OL,7,Fpromote tourism in Northamptonshire has
OL,8,Fbeen approved, a campaign group has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe On The Map group, made up of
OL,12,Fbusiness people from the county,
OL,13,Fsubmitted the 85-page application in
OL,14,FFebruary.
OL,16,FIt would be situated on the M1
OL,17,Fnorthbound at junction 15 and
OL,18,Fbusinessman John Henderson said the
OL,19,Fapproval from National Highways was
OL,20,F"fantastic" news.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
